WEBVTT

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:30.066
Thankfully, SAP had
a mentorship system in place

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:32.016
to support employees on the spectrum.

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:34.576
Bianca: We are here
to help our colleagues

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:36.321
in many different ways;

00:21:36.345 --> 00:21:40.666
not only to socialize,
but also to solve any problems.

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:42.746
AG: That's Bianca, Nico's mentor.

00:21:42.770 --> 00:21:44.106
He asked her for guidance.

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:47.186
Bianca: He says, "Hey,
we are doing this process

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:49.036
in a very manual way,

00:21:49.060 --> 00:21:51.616
so I'm going to automate this."

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:55.256
And, you know, I said,
"OK, well, go ahead!"

00:21:55.280 --> 00:21:58.184
AG: Research suggests that when
managers give people freedom,

00:21:58.208 --> 00:22:00.376
instead of saying, "That's not my job,"